     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"#0563C1\" vlink=\"#954F72\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">#maptimeDavis Workshop is  excited to present a crossover event with the Davis R Users Group: “From Spatial Data to Publication Ready Figure: Mapmaking with R” with instructor Ryan Peek,\r\n<b>Tuesday, Nov. 24<sup>th</sup> from 10:00-12:00 via Zoom</b>!  <a href=\"https://registration.genomecenter.ucdavis.edu/events/mtdmappingr/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://registration.genomecenter.ucdavis.edu/events/mtdmappingr/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465318631000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3cVqESOqsgup8AKuQf-5BX\">\r\nRegister</a> for this event.  <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">People of all levels of skill and experience are welcome! If you plan to follow along, introductory understanding of R will be helpful and please have R and R Studio installed on your computer. \r\n<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">We will meet on <b>Tuesday, Nov. 24<sup>th</sup> from 10:00-12:00 via Zoom</b>.  For more details and zoom link, see the\r\n<a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/spatial-sciences/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/spatial-sciences/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465318631000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1qY_RRHJWVrwXGefcS2Ifq\">Spatial Sciences Research &amp; Learning Cluster</a> page.  Please send questions to Michele Tobias –\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mmto...@ucdavis.edu</a><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">*** Upcoming #maptimeDavis Workshops &amp; Studios ***<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">***             Tuesdays, 10:00-12:00 via Zoom                  ***<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Date      Topic     Speaker<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">24-Nov  #maptimeDavis &amp; Davis R Users Group Workshop: <a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/maptimedavis-workshop-mapping-with-r/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/maptimedavis-workshop-mapping-with-r/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465318631000&amp;usg=AOvVaw19OxbVcZ6snsSAeaayduWV\">\r\nFrom Spatial Data to Publication Ready Figure: Mapmaking with R</a>              Ryan Peek<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">1-Dec    #maptimeDavis Studio: <a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/maptimedavis-studio-mapping-with-r/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/maptimedavis-studio-mapping-with-r/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465318631000&amp;usg=AOvVaw27Fori7CLsIoS7_9c0N6tJ\">\r\nMapping with R</a> Community Discussion<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Registration for workshops you plan to attend is highly encouraged but not required.  Please do not sign up for things you don’t plan to attend.  Whenever possible, the workshops will be recorded and posted on the\r\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTooXK1RiSHNbWsmeqz0W6g\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTooXK1RiSHNbWsmeqz0W6g&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465318632000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0DLyZs_9kOLkFdyt8wpT1k\">DataLab YouTube channel</a>.  Studio will not be recorded to encourage open discussion.  Weekly reminders will be sent on the\r\n<a href=\"https://lists.ucdavis.edu/sympa/info/geospatial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lists.ucdavis.edu/sympa/info/geospatial&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465318632000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1bBESWb-Lt3LVWL-laxcsG\">Geospatial Email List</a>.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"https://github.com/maptimedavis/MaptimeDavis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/maptimedavis/MaptimeDavis&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465318632000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0pAcoz3OlLU0G6HISa7CjN\">#maptimeDavis</a> Workshops and Studio are a product of\r\n<a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465318632000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2pfLFh8FAtWzNaL3LGzHkN\">UC Davis DataLab</a>’s  <a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/spatial-sciences/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/spatial-sciences/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465318632000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2As6TVAVCdMSI9L2DWay6j\">Spatial Sciences Research Cluster</a> and are supported by the contributions and participation of our community.  Please send questions to\r\n Michele Tobias <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mmto...@ucdavis.edu</a><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Michele Tobias, PhD<u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Geospatial Data Specialist<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">DataLab: Data Science &amp; Informatics<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Data &amp; Digital Scholarship<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">UC Davis Library <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">370 Shields Library<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><a href=\"tel:(530)%20752-7532\" value=\"+15307527532\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(530)752-7532</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">mmto...@ucdavis.edu</span></a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">ORCID: </span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Noto Sans&quot;;color:#494a4c;background:white\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2954-8710\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2954-8710&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465318632000&amp;usg=AOvVaw079EzB0-4LA5mBueMumSlL\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">0000-0002-2954-8710</span></a>\r\n</span><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Pronouns: she, her, hers<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
